iPhone Sales Dashboard
🚀 Project Overview
This dashboard was developed as a freelance project for a retail client in Kolkata aiming to expand business operations and implement ad‑hoc changes in day‑to‑day 
decision‑making. The solution leverages Power BI combined with data scraped from POS systems and sales logs, 
transformed through a structured ETL pipeline into actionable insights.


Technical Highlights
Field Navigation: Instead of creating multiple separate visualizations, a field parameter was implemented. This allows users to dynamically swap between dimensions 
(Age Distribution, Branch, Gender, Locality, Payment Method, iPhone Model) in a single bar chart without impacting model performance.
AI‑Generated Insights: Smart Narrative and AI‑driven analysis were integrated to automatically highlight sales trends, anomalies, and growth opportunities. 
This makes the dashboard self‑explanatory and reduces manual interpretation.
Visualization Optimization: Multiple charts were clubbed into unified visuals using parameters and slicers, improving performance and providing a cleaner user experience.

ETL Workflow:
Extract: Data scraped from POS and sales logs.
Transform: Cleaned, standardized, and enriched with calculated fields (Age Groups, Month-Year, Revenue KPIs).
Load: Integrated into Power BI for interactive exploration.

📈 AI Impact
Automated Narratives: AI insights explain revenue drivers, customer demographics, and payment trends in natural language.
Trend Forecasting: Identifies seasonal peaks and customer behavior shifts.
Conversion Strategies: Suggests how to turn low‑performing models, branches, or payment methods into growth opportunities.
Ease of Use: Non‑technical users can interact with the dashboard, swap parameters, and receive AI‑generated recommendations instantly.







